  "output": {
    "answer": "In my setup the rule was simple: a lane can flip its own dev flag, but only a human flips the production flag, and only explicitly the next morning — never as a side effect of a lane finishing. Anything touching a production flip needed my word specifically, named explicitly rather than buried in a report. That's as far as the record goes — it doesn't say how that maps onto a real team, what role would hold that authority, or how many people would need it. I only ran this solo, so team structure isn't something I can speak to from the record.",
